  "//overrides": "next 16.2.12 still bundles postcss 8.4.31, and pulls sharp 0.34.5 for image optimisation. Both carry high-severity advisories that `npm audit --omit=dev` reports against `next` itself, and npm's suggested `fix` is to downgrade to next@9.3.3 — i.e. back into the advisories this upgrade closed. Pinning the two patched transitives is the fix that keeps next current. Re-check on every next bump: when next ships them itself, delete this.",
